.DS_Store
.capture.log
.capture-transcript.tmp
.capture-extractor.tmp

# transcript-extractor regenerable output (personal; never commit)
transcript-extractor/parsed/

# Build metadata from a local `pip install -e .`. Regenerable; never source.
# (Committed once by accident in e8610ff — `git add -A` with no rule here.)
*.egg-info/

# ── Private working material ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are NOT public and NOT shipped. They live in the private
# automemory-logs repo instead, which took custody on 2026-10-15. Removing them
# from the tip does not unpublish them from git history — see the rewrite note.
#
#   system/design/  build notes: texture criteria, steering rubric, schema,
#                   engine docs. The steering material is the sensitive part.
#   product/        personal markdown (BUILD-SPEC, GLOSSARY, AGENT-SIDE).
system/design/
product/

# NOTE: agent-records/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Records used to be gitignored
# here on the theory that the product ships clean; in practice that deleted the
# corpus rather than protecting it. Records for this project are routed to the
# private automemory-logs repo (automemory enable --records ...). If any land
# here, they are meant to be versioned.